From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libc: res_init

apklayer patch (docs/PATCHES.md). bionic's libc exports res_init; glibc exports only __res_init (<resolv.h> makes res_init a macro for it), so the
bionic linker could not link OpenVPN for Android's libopenvpn.so ("cannot locate symbol res_init") and its process exited with 1 at start.

--- a/libc/libc-misc.c
+++ b/libc/libc-misc.c
@@ -69,3 +69,12 @@
 {
 	return 36;
 }
+
+/* apklayer patch: bionic's res_init; glibc has __res_init only (OpenVPN for Android's libopenvpn.so). */
+#ifdef __GLIBC__
+extern int __res_init(void);
+int bionic_res_init(void)
+{
+	return __res_init();
+}
+#endif
